..!interpreter german translate
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : ow1/IS.ADJNEGQTY.START
.. Date           : 18.12.13
.. Version        : 2012r4n05
.. Author         : dh/abas AG
.. Copyright      : (c) 2013 abas AG
.. Functionality  :
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..    uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..    uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
..    Argument     meaning
..    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
..
.. Program flow   : Query stock quantity to find items with negative balances.
..                  Populate table with these items
...Includes       : None
..*****************************************************************************
..
.art text xtsel               ? F|defined( U|xtsel )   = G|False
..
.formel U|xtsel = "$,,platz=;artikel=;lemge=!-0,01;@sort="+"Einzelmengen_auf_einem_Platz"
..
.hole lmenge 'U|xtsel'
.weiter ENDE ? G|mehr = G|False    
!HOLE
.mache maske zeile +O
.formel M|qart= H|artikel^id
.formel M|qartname = M|qart^name
.formel M|qlpl   = H|platz^id
.formel M|qmge   = H|lemge
.formel M|mindest = H|artikel^mindest
.hole lmenge
.weiter HOLE ? G|mehr = G|True
!ENDE
.weiter











